        {
            "title": "FIRST DEMO OUT NOW!",
            "date": "2025-07-24 13:18:03",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806064758616349",
            "content": "[p][b]The first demo is live! 🎉[/b][/p][p]Hey everyone!\nI'm super excited (and honestly a bit nervous) to announce that the [b]very first playable demo[/b] of [i]A Pretty Broken Adventure[/i] is now available![/p][p]This is still a very early stage of development, so please keep that in mind while playing. That said, I’d [i]love[/i] to hear what you think! Your feedback is incredibly valuable and will help shape the future of the game.[/p][p]👉 If you'd like to share your thoughts, please join our [url=\"https://discord.gg/hKuGMTnWWb\" style=\"button\"]Discord server[/url] and post in the [b]#demo-feedback[/b] channel. That way, I can respond more easily, keep everything in one place, and help avoid spoilers for other players.[/p][p]Thanks so much!![/p][p]I hope you enjoy this little first look into the world of [i]A Pretty Broken Adventure[/i]![/p][p]Chris[/p]"
        },
